<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: TABLE-RYANAIR PRETAX PROFIT 6.04 MLN PUNTS.</title>
<headline>TABLE-RYANAIR PRETAX PROFIT 6.04 MLN PUNTS.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to June 1997</p>
<p>			  (million punts unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.20		   vs 2.22</p>
<p> Shr (pence) adjusted   4.15		   vs 3.42</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    6.04		   vs 4.36</p>
<p> Operating revenue	41.32		  vs 30.93</p>
<p>NOTE - Ryanair Holdings Ltd, an Irish low-cost airline which launched on Nasdaq and the Irish Stock Exchanges in May, 1997, said trading conditions in the airline business continued to be tough.</p>
<p>-- Dublin newsroom + 353 1 676 9775</p>
</text>
